      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117273918719178022</guid>
      <link>https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117273918719178022</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 07:39:48 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A windows update that broke the Excel desktop versions of the last 10 years? &lt;br /&gt;wow if they had an online version of this software it would almost sound like a conspiracy theory to get people to move to those versions or something. Luckily I&amp;#39;m sure they&amp;#39;ll patch this quickly!!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.neowin.net/news/microsoft-confirms-september-2026-kb5002914-update-silently-break-excel-copy-paste/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;neowin.net/news/microsoft-conf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;irms-september-2026-kb5002914-update-silently-break-excel-copy-paste/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://cdn.masto.host/mastodongamedevplace/media_attachments/files/117/273/918/652/941/550/original/6cb3b622e0f65190.png" type="image/png" fileSize="54491" medium="image">
        <media:rating scheme="urn:simple">nonadult</media:rating>
      </media:content>
    </item>
    <item>
