      <link>https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117264748873906691</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:47:47 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This is why I don’t recommend movies more often, just saw Devil’s Mouth, solid B movie horror, above average I’d say; flawed sure but I was entertained the whole time. Checked ratings after and 4.7 on iMDB and 14% on Rotten. I might have terrible taste.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
