      <link>https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117263858121549846</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 13:01:15 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;lmao I’m so dumb I thought it was called “StarCraft 2030”, you know, like Warhammer 40000, not that it was the release year, that’s 4 years away, weird marketing strategy.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
