      <description>&lt;p&gt;was seeing buzz new Wolverine game was getting terrible reviews, opened both metacritic and opencritic and atm sitting at 78 and 79/100 respectively. not saying it will be a good game (depends on person) but I wouldn&amp;#39;t call that a bad score. Maybe for 10/10 trailers though&lt;/p&gt;</description>
